--TEST--
a key in the payload of a program's attribute is offered with its type and the `///` doc above its field in the declaration, `rule:attributes/an-attribute-is-declared-with-its-sites`, `rule:types/shape-type`
--FILE--
<?nvs
/// Adds a database index over this table.
attribute Index on class {
    /// The column names, separated by commas.
    columns: string,
    /// `true` means no two rows may have the same values in these columns.
    unique?: bool,
}

#[Index(<|>)]
class Order {}
--REQUEST--
completion
--EXPECT--
columns field     string
  doc: The column names, separated by commas.
unique  field     bool (optional)
  doc: `true` means no two rows may have the same values in these columns.
